(34, 15, 48, 1, 'selected_topic', 'to avoid confusion', 0, 1.00, 'partial_answer', 'You\'re right, clear names help to avoid confusion! To make your answer even better, you could explain what kind of confusion it helps to avoid, like not knowing which file is which, or struggling to find them.', '2026-06-21 07:58:07', '2026-06-21 07:51:09', '2026-06-21 08:21:13'),
(35, 15, 47, 2, 'selected_topic', 'To avoid compromising the computer. For example passwords', 0, 2.00, 'partial_answer', 'You correctly identified passwords as private information you should never share. Remember, adults can help you understand and stay safe from uncomfortable things you might see online.', '2026-06-21 08:09:34', '2026-06-21 07:51:09', '2026-06-21 08:21:17'),
(36, 15, 45, 3, 'selected_topic', 'Mouse: it is used to control the cursor for navigation\n\nKeyboard: Used to type information', 1, 4.00, NULL, 'Great job! You correctly named two main parts of a computer and explained their basic functions.', '2026-06-21 08:09:37', '2026-06-21 07:51:09', '2026-06-21 08:21:21'),
(37, 15, 46, 4, 'selected_topic', 'I dont know', 0, 0.00, 'no_answer', 'It\'s okay not to know! It\'s important to learn about safe computer use. Keeping your wrist straight and taking breaks are two good rules to remember.', '2026-06-21 08:09:58', '2026-06-21 07:51:09', '2026-06-21 08:21:23'),
(38, 15, 49, 5, 'selected_topic', 'I dont know', 0, 0.00, 'no_answer', 'It\'s okay not to know! We can review the steps for opening and closing a program together.', '2026-06-21 08:10:00', '2026-06-21 07:51:09', '2026-06-21 08:21:25'),
