(37, 'MANEB', 'MSCE', 'Mathematics', 'Coordinate Geometry', 'This topic covers geometric concepts using algebraic coordinates. It focuses on finding the gradient of a line, determining the equation of a line using points or angles, and working with parallel and perpendicular lines. In MSCE exams, you are frequently tested on relating the angle of inclination (\\(\\theta \\)) to the gradient (\\(m\\)) using trigonometry.', 1.00, 130, NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-07-04 08:03:29', '2026-07-04 11:57:12'),
