(22, 3, 137, 137, 16, 77, 53, NULL, NULL, 'Year 2 Creative Writing', 'Generated from approved Full Syllabus extraction. Source: 134911-unit-g103-theme-1-scheme-of-work.doc.pdf', '{\"flat_objectives\":[],\"subtopics\":[],\"topics\":[{\"title\":\"Inequalities in living standards\",\"notes\":\"This theme responds to two key aspects of the economic, political and ethical debate over global inequality in the last 25 years – debates which continue to be urgently relevant. The UN’s Millennium Development Goals identify inequalities in health and the consequences of those inequalities as a major factor in global injustice, and seek to make progress in tackling them by 2015. From the Live 8 response to G8 international debt agreement to continuing debates over aid and trade, broader inequalities of wealth and their consequences continue to be a major issue. This sequence of lessons provides some starting points for students to explore these problems and both gather and evaluate relevant evidence in order to increase their levels of knowledge. It then goes on to provide some structured sequences for debating and judging this evidence, and producing sustained academic arguments in written form.\",\"criteria\":[],\"subtopics\":[{\"title\":\"Introduction to the theme and the unit\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"identify\"],\"detail\":\"the overall content (theme areas) and assessment focus of this unit.\",\"text\":\"Identify the overall content (theme areas) and assessment focus of this unit.\"},{\"actions\":[\"apply\"],\"detail\":\"a checklist to conduct an audit of skills learnt at AS, including critical analysis of sources, research, writing, and presentational skills.\",\"text\":\"Apply a checklist to conduct an audit of skills learnt at AS, including critical analysis of sources, research, writing, and presentational skills.\"},{\"actions\":[\"describe\"],\"detail\":\"the results of the skills audit with peers and the class.\",\"text\":\"Describe the results of the skills audit with peers and the class.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Inequalities in health – what is happening?\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"identify\"],\"detail\":\"the context of the UN’s Millennium Development Goals by exploring the official website.\",\"text\":\"Identify the context of the UN’s Millennium Development Goals by exploring the official website.\"},{\"actions\":[\"identify\"],\"detail\":\"specific inequalities of health highlighted in the ‘Make it Happen’ (2008) video.\",\"text\":\"Identify specific inequalities of health highlighted in the ‘Make it Happen’ (2008) video.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\"],\"detail\":\"the credibility and reliability of sources, considering reputation, selectivity, and currency.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate the credibility and reliability of sources, considering reputation, selectivity, and currency.\"},{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"data and context for child health (Goal 4), maternal health (Goal 5), and reducing HIV/AIDS (Goal 6) from UN resources.\",\"text\":\"Analyse data and context for child health (Goal 4), maternal health (Goal 5), and reducing HIV/AIDS (Goal 6) from UN resources.\"},{\"actions\":[\"describe\"],\"detail\":\"findings on specific health goals to the class.\",\"text\":\"Describe findings on specific health goals to the class.\"},{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"health inequity based on the UN WHO factfile.\",\"text\":\"Define health inequity based on the UN WHO factfile.\"},{\"actions\":[\"identify\"],\"detail\":\"factors associated with the causes of health inequity from the UN WHO factfile.\",\"text\":\"Identify factors associated with the causes of health inequity from the UN WHO factfile.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Why is this happening? Investigating the evidence base.\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"evidence on sanitation, clean water, adequate nutrition, and access to medicines using provided resources.\",\"text\":\"Analyse evidence on sanitation, clean water, adequate nutrition, and access to medicines using provided resources.\"},{\"actions\":[\"analyse\",\"evaluate\"],\"detail\":\"evidence in terms of credibility, reliability, relevance, and significance.\",\"text\":\"Analyse evidence in terms of credibility, reliability, relevance, and significance.\"},{\"actions\":[\"identify\"],\"detail\":\"relevant evidence related to the causes of health inequality.\",\"text\":\"Identify relevant evidence related to the causes of health inequality.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\",\"explain\"],\"detail\":\"evidence to support understanding of health inequality causes.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate evidence to support understanding of health inequality causes.\"},{\"actions\":[\"apply\"],\"detail\":\"identified evidence to possible causes of health inequality.\",\"text\":\"Apply identified evidence to possible causes of health inequality.\"},{\"actions\":[\"create\",\"identify\"],\"detail\":\"a poster presentation identifying, evaluating, and linking evidence to health inequality causes.\",\"text\":\"Create a poster presentation identifying, evaluating, and linking evidence to health inequality causes.\"}]},{\"title\":\"What, if any, action needs to be taken? Analysing and evaluating contrasting arguments.\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"the argument structure of two opposing viewpoints on solutions to global health inequalities.\",\"text\":\"Analyse the argument structure of two opposing viewpoints on solutions to global health inequalities.\"},{\"actions\":[\"identify\",\"compare\"],\"detail\":\"the two positions presented in contrasting arguments.\",\"text\":\"Identify the two positions presented in contrasting arguments.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\"],\"detail\":\"the strength of arguments based on previously explored evidence.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate the strength of arguments based on previously explored evidence.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\",\"explain\"],\"detail\":\"personal judgments on the issue of global health inequalities.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate personal judgments on the issue of global health inequalities.\"},{\"actions\":[\"explain\"],\"detail\":\"the current situation of global health inequalities with relevant examples.\",\"text\":\"Explain the current situation of global health inequalities with relevant examples.\"},{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"the evidence for why global health inequalities are happening.\",\"text\":\"Analyse the evidence for why global health inequalities are happening.\"},{\"actions\":[\"create\",\"explain\"],\"detail\":\"the best solution to global health inequalities.\",\"text\":\"Create the best solution to global health inequalities.\"}]}]},{\"title\":\"Global Inequalities and Wealth Distribution\",\"notes\":\"This topic explores the issues of global inequalities, focusing specifically on the distribution of wealth between countries, its causes, and potential solutions. Students will engage in research, analysis, and debate to understand the complexities of global economic disparities and the responsibilities of nations.\",\"criteria\":[],\"subtopics\":[{\"title\":\"The distribution of wealth between countries: What is happening?\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"Generate ideas about global patterns of wealth distribution.\",\"text\":\"Define Generate ideas about global patterns of wealth distribution.\"},{\"actions\":[\"describe\"],\"detail\":\"global patterns using key terms such as ‘wealth distribution’ and ‘income inequality’.\",\"text\":\"Describe global patterns using key terms such as ‘wealth distribution’ and ‘income inequality’.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Why is it happening? Exploring explanations for inequality of wealth through research.\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"Undertake research to gather sources on explanations for wealth inequality.\",\"text\":\"Define Undertake research to gather sources on explanations for wealth inequality.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\"],\"detail\":\"sources for credibility and bias.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate sources for credibility and bias.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Why is it happening? Recording answers.\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"Record collected data about inequalities of wealth and possible explanations.\",\"text\":\"Analyse Record collected data about inequalities of wealth and possible explanations.\"},{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"Annotate a world map with data and explanations for wealth inequalities.\",\"text\":\"Define Annotate a world map with data and explanations for wealth inequalities.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\",\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"collected information as a class.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate collected information as a class.\"},{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"specific information for the exam.\",\"text\":\"Define specific information for the exam.\"}]},{\"title\":\"What, if any, action needs to be taken? Proposing some answers.\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"Participate in a debate on solutions to global wealth inequality, specifically reforming trade.\",\"text\":\"Define Participate in a debate on solutions to global wealth inequality, specifically reforming trade.\"},{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"arguments related to fair trade.\",\"text\":\"Analyse arguments related to fair trade.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\"],\"detail\":\"arguments related to fair trade.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate arguments related to fair trade.\"},{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"Propose solutions to global inequality of wealth.\",\"text\":\"Define Propose solutions to global inequality of wealth.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Combining the questions: writing task\",\"notes\":\"\",\"criteria\":[{\"actions\":[\"define\"],\"detail\":\"Generate materials for an essay answering the question: ‘To what extent are rich nations responsible for solving the problems experienced by poorer ones?’\",\"text\":\"Define Generate materials for an essay answering the question: ‘To what extent are rich nations responsible for solving the problems experienced by poorer ones?’\"},{\"actions\":[\"create\"],\"detail\":\"an essay on the responsibility of rich nations for solving problems in poorer ones.\",\"text\":\"Create an essay on the responsibility of rich nations for solving problems in poorer ones.\"},{\"actions\":[\"evaluate\",\"apply\"],\"detail\":\"on previous essay feedback and implement targets.\",\"text\":\"Evaluate on previous essay feedback and implement targets.\"},{\"actions\":[\"explain\"],\"detail\":\"the situation of global inequalities with examples.\",\"text\":\"Explain the situation of global inequalities with examples.\"},{\"actions\":[\"analyse\"],\"detail\":\"evidence for why global inequalities are happening.\",\"text\":\"Analyse evidence for why global inequalities are happening.\"},{\"actions\":[\"explain\"],\"detail\":\"Suggest and justify solutions to global inequalities.\",\"text\":\"Explain Suggest and justify solutions to global inequalities.\"}]}]}]}', 'approved', 'Built from approved syllabus extraction items.', NULL, '2026-07-02 13:02:43', '2026-07-02 13:02:43', '2026-07-02 13:02:43', '2026-07-02 13:02:43');
