(35, 1, 9, 35, 31, 136, NULL, 'multiple_choice', 'What do farmers grow in their fields to sell?', '[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"Toys\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"Books\"},{\"label\":\"C\",\"text\":\"Vegetables\"},{\"label\":\"D\",\"text\":\"Cars\"}]', 'C', '[\"C\"]', 'Farmers grow crops like vegetables, fruits, and grains in their fields. They sell these to people so they can eat them.', 'Some children might think farmers sell things they see in shops, not realizing they produce the food first.', 'easy', 'recall', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-20 16:18:06', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 16:16:37', '2026-06-20 16:18:06', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(36, 1, 9, 35, 31, 136, NULL, 'multiple_choice', 'Why do farmers sell the food they grow or the milk from their cows?', '[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"To play games\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"To get money\"},{\"label\":\"C\",\"text\":\"To make friends\"},{\"label\":\"D\",\"text\":\"To sleep\"}]', 'B', '[\"B\"]', 'Farmers sell their produce to get money. This money helps them buy things they need for the farm and for their families, like seeds, tools, and clothes.', 'Children might not connect selling with earning money for necessities.', 'easy', 'recall', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-20 16:18:07', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 16:16:38', '2026-06-20 16:18:07', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(37, 1, 9, 35, 31, 136, NULL, 'multiple_choice', 'What might a farmer need to buy for their farm?', '[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"Candy\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"New shoes\"},{\"label\":\"C\",\"text\":\"Seeds for planting\"},{\"label\":\"D\",\"text\":\"A television\"}]', 'C', '[\"C\"]', 'To grow new crops, farmers need to buy seeds. They also buy other things like animal feed, tools, and fuel for their tractors.', 'Students might choose personal items rather than farm-related necessities.', 'easy', 'recall', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-20 16:18:09', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 16:16:38', '2026-06-20 16:18:09', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(38, 1, 9, 35, 31, 136, NULL, 'multiple_choice', 'Who often helps a farmer with their work on the farm?', '[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"The postman\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"Their family\"},{\"label\":\"C\",\"text\":\"The doctor\"},{\"label\":\"D\",\"text\":\"The teacher\"}]', 'B', '[\"B\"]', 'Farms are often family businesses, and many family members help with different jobs like planting, harvesting, or taking care of animals.', 'Children might think only one person works on a farm, or choose other community helpers.', 'easy', 'recall', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-20 16:18:11', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 16:16:39', '2026-06-20 16:18:11', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(39, 1, 9, 35, 31, 136, NULL, 'multiple_choice', 'What is a \'farm business\' mostly about?', '[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"Playing all day\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"Making decisions about what to grow and sell\"},{\"label\":\"C\",\"text\":\"Watching movies\"},{\"label\":\"D\",\"text\":\"Eating snacks\"}]', 'B', '[\"B\"]', 'A farm business is about making choices, like what crops to plant, which animals to raise, and how to sell them to earn money. It\'s like running a small shop that sells food.', 'Students might confuse \'business\' with leisure activities.', 'easy', 'comprehension', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-20 16:18:12', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 16:16:39', '2026-06-20 16:18:12', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(40, 1, 9, 35, 31, 137, NULL, 'short_answer', 'What is the ground called where a farmer grows crops?', '[]', 'Land', '[\"Land\",\"Field\",\"Soil\"]', 'Land is a main factor of agricultural production because it\'s the essential space where crops are grown and animals can live. Without land, farming cannot happen.', 'Students might name a specific crop (e.g., \'corn\') or an animal (e.g., \'cow\') instead of the land itself, confusing the product with the factor of production.', 'easy', 'identify', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:25:32', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-21 08:25:32', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(41, 1, 9, 35, 31, 137, NULL, 'short_answer', 'Name one person who works on a farm to help grow food.', '[]', 'Farmer', '[\"Farmer\",\"Helper\",\"Worker\"]', 'Labor, which refers to the people working, is a main factor because farmers and their helpers do all the physical and mental work to plant, care for, and harvest crops, as well as look after animals.', 'Students might name an animal (e.g., \'chicken\') or a machine (e.g., \'tractor\') instead of a person involved in the labor.', 'easy', 'list', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:25:33', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-21 08:25:33', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(42, 1, 9, 35, 31, 137, NULL, 'short_answer', 'What do farmers use to buy things like seeds, tools, or tractors?', '[]', 'Money', '[\"Money\",\"Capital\",\"Funds\"]', 'Capital refers to the money, tools, machines, and buildings farmers use to run their farm. It\'s a main factor because these resources are needed to acquire supplies and equipment for production.', 'Students might name a specific tool (e.g., \'tractor\') instead of the general concept of money or capital that allows them to acquire such tools.', 'easy', 'identify', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:25:34', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-21 08:25:34', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(43, 1, 9, 35, 31, 137, NULL, 'short_answer', 'Why is it important for a farmer to have a good plan for their farm?', '[]', 'To grow good food', '[\"To grow good food\",\"To make the farm work well\",\"To know what to do\",\"To be successful\"]', 'Management (or entrepreneurship) is about the farmer\'s skills in planning, organizing, and making decisions for the farm. It\'s a main factor because good planning helps the farm be efficient and successful in producing food.', 'Students might give a very general answer like \'to be happy\' without linking it to the practical success or output of the farm.', 'easy', 'explain', 1, 0.800, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:25:36', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-21 08:25:36', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(44, 1, 9, 35, 31, 137, NULL, 'short_answer', 'Name one of the main things a farmer needs to grow crops, besides people.', '[]', 'Land', '[\"Land\",\"Money\",\"Tools\",\"Tractor\",\"Seeds\"]', 'Besides labor (people), farmers need other main factors like land to plant on and capital (such as money, tools, or seeds) to help them grow crops. These are fundamental for agricultural production.', 'Students might name a person (which was excluded by the question) or an animal, rather than focusing on the other core factors of production.', 'easy', 'list', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:25:37', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-21 08:25:37', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(45, 1, 9, 37, 35, 215, NULL, 'structured', 'Name two main parts of a desktop computer and explain one basic function for each part you named.', '[]', 'Award 1 mark for each correctly named computer part (e.g., Monitor, Keyboard, Mouse, System Unit, Speakers). Award 1 mark for a correct basic function for each named part. For example: Monitor - shows what is happening on the computer screen; Keyboard - used to type letters and numbers; Mouse - used to click on things and move the pointer; System Unit - the \'brain\' of the computer where all the processing happens; Speakers - play sounds from the computer.', '[\"Monitor: displays images/text\",\"Keyboard: types letters/numbers\",\"Mouse: clicks/moves pointer\",\"System Unit: processes information\",\"Speakers: plays sound\"]', 'Understanding the main parts of a computer and their basic functions is fundamental to using a computer effectively. Each part plays a specific role in how you interact with the computer and how it processes information.', 'Students might name a part but struggle to explain its function clearly, or confuse the functions of similar parts (e.g., monitor and speakers both output information, but one is visual and the other is audio).', 'medium', 'explain', 4, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 07:40:34', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 07:40:02', '2026-06-25 15:05:37', NULL, 2, 33.33, 0, NULL),
(46, 1, 9, 37, 35, 215, NULL, 'structured', 'Describe two important rules for using a computer mouse safely to prevent discomfort or injury to your hand and wrist.', '[]', 'Award 2 marks for each clear and correct rule for safe mouse use. Examples include: 1. Keep your wrist straight and relaxed, not bent. 2. Use a light grip on the mouse, don\'t squeeze it too hard. 3. Take short breaks often to rest your hand. 4. Use your whole arm to move the mouse, not just your wrist. 5. Ensure the mouse is close to your body.', '[\"Keep wrist straight and relaxed\",\"Use a light grip on the mouse\",\"Take regular breaks\",\"Move mouse with arm, not just wrist\",\"Keep mouse close to body\"]', 'Using input devices like the mouse and keyboard correctly is important for your health. Maintaining good posture and safe habits helps prevent strain and discomfort, especially when using the computer for extended periods.', 'Students might focus on general computer safety (like not eating near the computer) rather than specific physical safety related to mouse use. They might also give vague answers like \'be careful\'.', 'medium', 'describe', 4, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 07:40:38', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 07:40:02', '2026-06-25 15:04:59', NULL, 3, 50.00, 0, NULL),
(47, 1, 9, 37, 35, 215, NULL, 'structured', 'Explain why it is important to ask an adult for help if you see something on the computer that makes you feel uncomfortable. Give one example of private information you should never share online.', '[]', 'Award 2 marks for explaining why to ask an adult: Adults can help understand what you saw, protect you from harmful content, or report inappropriate content. Award 2 marks for one correct example of private information: full name, home address, phone number, school name, passwords, photos of yourself or family without permission.', '[\"Adults can help understand/protect/report\",\"Full name\",\"Home address\",\"Phone number\",\"School name\",\"Passwords\"]', 'Digital safety is crucial. If something makes you uncomfortable online, an adult can provide guidance and ensure your safety. Sharing private information can put you at risk, so it\'s vital to know what to keep secret.', 'Students might struggle to articulate *why* asking an adult is important beyond \'they will help\'. For private information, they might list things that aren\'t strictly private (e.g., favorite color).', 'medium', 'explain', 4, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 07:40:42', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 07:40:02', '2026-06-25 15:05:59', NULL, 2, 33.33, 0, NULL),
(48, 1, 9, 37, 35, 215, NULL, 'structured', 'Imagine you have created a drawing of a cat and a story about a dog on the computer. Explain why it is important to save these files with clear and different names.', '[]', 'Award 1 mark for each valid reason, up to 3 marks. Reasons include: 1. To easily find the files later. 2. To know what is inside each file without opening it. 3. To prevent accidentally overwriting one file with another if they have the same name. 4. To keep your computer files organised.', '[\"Easily find files later\",\"Know content without opening\",\"Prevent overwriting files\",\"Keep files organised\"]', 'Saving files with clear and distinct names is a good practice for digital organisation. It helps you manage your work, find what you need quickly, and avoid losing important documents.', 'Students might only give one reason or state \'it\'s good to save\' without explaining *why* clear and different names are important.', 'medium', 'explain', 3, 0.850, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 07:40:47', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 07:40:02', '2026-06-25 14:49:23', NULL, 2, 0.00, 0, NULL),
(49, 1, 9, 37, 35, 215, NULL, 'structured', 'List the basic steps you would take to open a simple drawing program on the computer and then close it when you are finished.', '[]', 'Award 1 mark for each correct step, up to 4 marks. \nTo open: 1. Click on the Start button (or equivalent). 2. Find the drawing program icon/name. 3. Click on the icon/name to open it. \nTo close: 1. Click on the \'X\' button in the top right corner of the program window. 2. If prompted, choose to save your work or not.', '[\"Click Start button\",\"Find program icon/name\",\"Click icon/name to open\",\"Click \'X\' button to close\",\"Choose to save/not save if prompted\"]', 'Knowing how to open and close programs is a fundamental skill for using a computer. These steps are common across many applications and operating systems.', 'Students might miss a step, such as clicking the \'X\' to close, or might not mention the \'Start\' button for opening. They might also confuse opening/closing with turning the computer on/off.', 'medium', 'list', 4, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 07:40:52', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 07:40:02', '2026-06-25 14:48:31', NULL, 1, 0.00, 0, NULL),
(50, 1, 9, 37, 27, 201, NULL, 'multiple_choice', 'Which of these is a natural feature?', '[{\"label\":\"A\",\"text\":\"A school building\"},{\"label\":\"B\",\"text\":\"A river\"},{\"label\":\"C\",\"text\":\"A road\"},{\"label\":\"D\",\"text\":\"A bridge\"}]', 'B', '[]', 'Natural features are things found in nature, not made by people. A river is a natural feature, while schools, roads, and bridges are human-made.', 'Confusing human-made structures with natural elements.', 'easy', 'classify', 1, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:29:16', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 08:26:18', '2026-06-21 08:29:16', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
(51, 1, 9, 37, 27, 201, NULL, 'short_answer', 'Name two human-made features you can see in your local environment.', '[]', 'Accept any two valid human-made features such as: school, house, road, bridge, shop, park (if it has human-made structures like swings).', '[\"school\",\"house\",\"road\",\"bridge\",\"shop\",\"park\"]', 'Human-made features are structures or objects built by people. Examples include buildings, roads, and bridges.', 'Listing natural features instead of human-made ones.', 'easy', 'identify', 2, 0.900, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:29:18', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 08:26:18', '2026-06-21 08:29:18', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
