(55, 1, 9, 37, 27, 201, NULL, 'short_answer', 'If you are standing in front of your classroom door, and the teacher\'s desk is to your right, where is the window if it is behind the teacher\'s desk?', '[]', 'The window is behind you and to your right (or simply \'behind the teacher\'s desk\').', '[\"behind the teacher\'s desk\",\"behind you and to your right\"]', 'Using position words like \'right\' and \'behind\' helps us understand where things are located relative to each other.', 'Getting confused with multiple position words or relative directions.', 'easy', 'use', 1, 0.800, 'ai_generated', 'approved', 32, 32, '2026-06-21 08:29:21', 'gemini-2.5-flash', '2026-06-21 08:26:18', '2026-06-21 08:29:21', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL),
