(50, 40, 'basic', 'Land is a main factor of agricultural production because it\'s the essential space where crops are grown and animals can live. Without land, farming cannot happen.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-20 17:09:55'),
(51, 41, 'basic', 'Labor, which refers to the people working, is a main factor because farmers and their helpers do all the physical and mental work to plant, care for, and harvest crops, as well as look after animals.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-20 17:09:55'),
(52, 42, 'basic', 'Capital refers to the money, tools, machines, and buildings farmers use to run their farm. It\'s a main factor because these resources are needed to acquire supplies and equipment for production.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-20 17:09:55'),
(53, 43, 'basic', 'Management (or entrepreneurship) is about the farmer\'s skills in planning, organizing, and making decisions for the farm. It\'s a main factor because good planning helps the farm be efficient and successful in producing food.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-20 17:09:55'),
(54, 44, 'basic', 'Besides labor (people), farmers need other main factors like land to plant on and capital (such as money, tools, or seeds) to help them grow crops. These are fundamental for agricultural production.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-20 17:09:55', '2026-06-20 17:09:55'),
(55, 45, 'basic', 'Understanding the main parts of a computer and their basic functions is fundamental to using a computer effectively. Each part plays a specific role in how you interact with the computer and how it processes information.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 07:40:02', '2026-06-21 07:40:02'),
