(78, 52, 'basic', 'Throwing waste in the bin helps keep the school clean and tidy, which is an important way to care for the environment. The other options are harmful.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 08:26:18', '2026-06-21 08:26:18'),
