(116, 69, 'basic', 'Weather observations help us predict future conditions and make practical decisions, such as choosing appropriate clothing.', 'approved', 0, 32, '2026-06-21 08:29:29', '2026-06-21 08:29:29'),
(117, 70, 'basic', 'In a fair test, only one variable should be changed at a time to ensure that any observed results are directly caused by that specific change. All other conditions must be kept constant to prevent them from influencing the outcome, allowing for a clear cause-and-effect relationship to be identified.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 22:10:42', '2026-06-21 22:10:42'),
(118, 71, 'basic', 'Responsible use of natural resources ensures that they are not depleted, allowing future generations to also benefit from them. This concept is known as sustainability, which is about meeting our own needs without compromising the ability of future generations to meet their own needs.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 22:10:42', '2026-06-21 22:10:42'),
(119, 72, 'basic', 'The Earth\'s rotation causes different parts of the planet to face the sun, resulting in day and night. This rotation leads to distinct observable features in the sky, such as the presence of the sun and brightness during the day, and the moon and stars against a dark sky at night.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 22:10:42', '2026-06-21 22:10:42'),
(120, 73, 'basic', 'A scientific question needs to be testable and specific. When observing and recording, it\'s important to have a clear method for measurement and a structured way to document the results, such as a table, to make comparisons easy and reliable.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 22:10:42', '2026-06-21 22:10:42'),
(121, 74, 'basic', 'A fair test is crucial in science to ensure that any observed changes are due to the specific variable being tested, and not other factors. By changing only one thing (the independent variable) and keeping all other conditions the same (controlled variables), scientists can confidently conclude the cause-and-effect relationship.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-21 22:10:42', '2026-06-21 22:10:42'),
(122, 70, 'basic', 'In a fair test, only one variable should be changed at a time to ensure that any observed results are directly caused by that specific change. All other conditions must be kept constant to prevent them from influencing the outcome, allowing for a clear cause-and-effect relationship to be identified.', 'approved', 0, 38, '2026-06-21 22:12:59', '2026-06-21 22:12:59'),
(123, 70, 'basic', 'In a fair test, only one variable should be changed at a time to ensure that any observed results are directly caused by that specific change. All other conditions must be kept constant to prevent them from influencing the outcome, allowing for a clear cause-and-effect relationship to be identified.', 'approved', 0, 38, '2026-06-21 22:13:01', '2026-06-21 22:13:01'),
