(125, 72, 'basic', 'The Earth\'s rotation causes different parts of the planet to face the sun, resulting in day and night. This rotation leads to distinct observable features in the sky, such as the presence of the sun and brightness during the day, and the moon and stars against a dark sky at night.', 'approved', 0, 38, '2026-06-21 22:13:21', '2026-06-21 22:13:21'),
