(127, 74, 'basic', 'A fair test is crucial in science to ensure that any observed changes are due to the specific variable being tested, and not other factors. By changing only one thing (the independent variable) and keeping all other conditions the same (controlled variables), scientists can confidently conclude the cause-and-effect relationship.', 'approved', 0, 38, '2026-06-21 22:13:49', '2026-06-21 22:13:49'),
(128, 75, 'basic', 'In the number 375, the digit \'7\' is in the tens place. This means its value is 7 tens, which is 70.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-22 06:25:11', '2026-06-22 06:25:11'),
(129, 76, 'basic', 'To solve 245 + 132, you can add the ones (5+2=7), then the tens (40+30=70), then the hundreds (200+100=300). Adding these together: 300 + 70 + 7 = 377.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-22 06:25:11', '2026-06-22 06:25:11'),
(130, 77, 'basic', 'Centimetres are too small for a classroom. Millilitres measure capacity, not length. Metres are a sensible unit for measuring the length of larger objects like a classroom.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-22 06:25:11', '2026-06-22 06:25:11'),
(131, 78, 'basic', 'A triangle is a 2D shape defined by having three straight sides and three vertices (corners).', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-22 06:25:11', '2026-06-22 06:25:11'),
(132, 79, 'basic', 'To order numbers, compare their hundreds digit first. 152 has 1 hundred, 215 has 2 hundreds, and 512 has 5 hundreds. So, 152 is the smallest, followed by 215, and then 512.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-06-22 06:25:11', '2026-06-22 06:25:11'),
