(138, 80, 'basic', 'Trees are important because they provide shade, which helps keep us cool. They also give us fruits, clean the air, and provide homes for animals.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 09:13:40', '2026-07-02 09:13:40'),
(139, 81, 'basic', 'Trees provide homes for many animals and help hold the soil in place. When they are cut down, animals lose their habitats, and the soil can be eroded by wind and rain. Trees also help keep the air clean.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 09:13:40', '2026-07-02 09:13:40'),
(140, 82, 'basic', 'Bush fires burn down plants and trees, which destroys the places where animals live. They also kill animals and make the air smoky and unhealthy.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 09:13:40', '2026-07-02 09:13:40'),
(141, 83, 'basic', 'Keeping water sources clean is very important for everyone\'s health. Simple actions like not littering near or in the water, and preventing dirty water from entering, can make a big difference.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 09:13:40', '2026-07-02 09:13:40'),
(142, 84, 'basic', 'Protecting our environment means taking care of the land, water, and air around us. Simple actions like proper waste disposal, planting trees, and conserving water all help.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 09:13:40', '2026-07-02 09:13:40'),
(143, 81, 'basic', 'Trees provide homes for many animals and help hold the soil in place. When they are cut down, animals lose their habitats, and the soil can be eroded by wind and rain. Trees also help keep the air clean.', 'approved', 0, 137, '2026-07-02 09:14:11', '2026-07-02 09:14:11'),
(144, 82, 'basic', 'Bush fires burn down plants and trees, which destroys the places where animals live. They also kill animals and make the air smoky and unhealthy.', 'approved', 0, 137, '2026-07-02 09:14:13', '2026-07-02 09:14:13'),
(145, 83, 'basic', 'Keeping water sources clean is very important for everyone\'s health. Simple actions like not littering near or in the water, and preventing dirty water from entering, can make a big difference.', 'approved', 0, 137, '2026-07-02 09:14:14', '2026-07-02 09:14:14'),
(146, 84, 'basic', 'Protecting our environment means taking care of the land, water, and air around us. Simple actions like proper waste disposal, planting trees, and conserving water all help.', 'approved', 0, 137, '2026-07-02 09:14:15', '2026-07-02 09:14:15'),
(147, 80, 'basic', 'Trees are important because they provide shade, which helps keep us cool. They also give us fruits, clean the air, and provide homes for animals.', 'approved', 0, 137, '2026-07-02 09:14:16', '2026-07-02 09:14:16'),
(148, 85, 'basic', 'A hoe is a common farm tool specifically designed for digging, cultivating soil, and removing weeds. A rake is for gathering, a watering can for watering, and a wheelbarrow for transporting.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(149, 86, 'basic', 'A watering can is a common and essential tool for providing water to plants, especially in a small garden. A hose or bucket can also be used.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(150, 87, 'basic', 'Rakes have teeth that are effective for sweeping and leveling surfaces, making them ideal for clearing garden beds or preparing soil.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(151, 88, 'basic', 'Putting tools away safely prevents accidents, keeps the garden tidy, and helps to preserve the tools for future use.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(152, 89, 'basic', 'Soil can contain bacteria and other microorganisms. Washing hands helps maintain hygiene and prevents the spread of illness.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(153, 90, 'basic', 'Holding a hoe with one hand near the top and the other lower down provides better leverage, control, and balance, making it safer and more effective for digging.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(154, 91, 'basic', 'Carrying sharp tools with the blade pointing downwards or behind you prevents accidental cuts to yourself or others, especially if you trip.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(155, 92, 'basic', 'Following safety rules for each tool prevents common accidents. For a hoe, the sharp blade can cause injury if not carried correctly. For a rake, upward-facing teeth can cause someone to trip or step on them.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(156, 93, 'basic', 'The description perfectly matches a rake, which is designed with teeth to collect loose materials or level surfaces.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
(157, 94, 'basic', 'Storing tools correctly prevents them from being a tripping hazard, protects them from weather, and ensures they are easy to find next time.', 'pending_review', 1, NULL, '2026-07-02 12:09:39', '2026-07-02 12:09:39'),
